{"id": 3275, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "ds-flash", "edited_zh": "【直哉】「在『故事』里，讲的是听见了像呻吟声一样的东西，那彩野同学在『现实』里，听说过这样的故事吗？」", "reason_code": "其他", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 3285, "verdict": "keep_opus", "chosen_channel": null, "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "其他", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
