{"id": 11913, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": "朝课桌下面探头看去。靠近墙边的地方躺着两团白色的橡胶块，看上去像是我的橡皮。", "reason_code": "其他", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 11921, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "过度归化", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
