{"id": 11960, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": "【アヤノ】「不要过来！ 我再也不想看到ユウイチ的脸了！」", "reason_code": "其他", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 11965, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": "环视四周，只见混凝土地面上落着格子状的影子，明暗对比强烈极了。忽然，那影子，晃悠悠地动了一下。", "reason_code": "其他", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 11970, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 11971, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
