{"id": 12009, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": "就像有人按下了录像机的播放键一样，サクラ同学的话在脑海里重新响了起来。", "reason_code": "其他", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 12014, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "ds-flash", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 12015, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 12021, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": "无休无止地，没完没了地，只有转角平台还在延续。", "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 12027, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 12034, "verdict": "adopt", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": null, "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
{"id": 12042, "verdict": "edit", "chosen_channel": "fable-wf", "edited_zh": "我沿着围栏一圈一圈地绕着走。可是，那里一个人也没有。谁的身影都看不见。", "reason_code": "语序", "ts": "2026-08-10T23:40:05+0800"}
